  "rows": [
    {
      "key": "tafde055893157296",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A position can therefore experience both a spread and slippage.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Uma posição pode, portanto, sofrer um spread e uma derrapagem.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c7dde3ba1eba5d3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">During holidays</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Durante os feriados</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t02a4bc252ca19e7b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">During quieter trading sessions</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Durante sessões de negociação mais calmas</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td9ce28ab8b860ea5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is one reason </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">slippage in forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> may become more noticeable during highly volatile periods.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Esse é um dos motivos pelos quais a </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">derrapagem no Forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> pode se tornar mais perceptível durante períodos altamente voláteis.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf83e9cf7af494521",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Price movement during that interval can contribute to slippage.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">O movimento dos preços durante esse intervalo pode contribuir para a derrapagem.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t28c20cc4f4fe7eea",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Limit orders work differently.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">As ordens limitadas funcionam de forma diferente.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tef1b07454f929663",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understanding this difference is important because managing slippage often involves choosing between execution certainty and price control.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Compreender esta diferença é importante porque a gestão da derrapagem envolve frequentemente a escolha entre a certeza de execução e o controlo de preços.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taa0458771b7c9ee5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive Slippage vs Negative Slippage: What's the Difference?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Derrapagem positiva vs derrapagem negativa: qual é a diferença?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t467bf38c9b2c5f8c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive slippage means an order executes at a price more favorable than expected. Negative slippage means the execution price is less favorable.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A derrapagem positiva significa que uma ordem é executada a um preço mais favorável do que o esperado. A derrapagem negativa significa que o preço de execução é menos favorável.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t47d0a9cefffe82a2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lower execution price = positive slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Preço de execução mais baixo = derrapagem positiva</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tab623a2858d39f10",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher execution price = negative slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Preço de execução mais alto = derrapagem negativa</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8c2ac3988d0d79d8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher execution price = positive slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Preço de execução mais alto = derrapagem positiva</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taf9db31677145e6a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lower execution price = negative slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Preço de execução mais baixo = derrapagem negativa</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t07b8dd3936a3227b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">It should not automatically be interpreted as evidence that a broker deliberately selected one outcome. Individual fills need to be considered alongside market conditions, liquidity, order type, timing, execution rules, and available pricing.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Isso não deve ser automaticamente interpretado como prova de que uma corretora escolheu deliberadamente um resultado. As execuções individuais devem ser avaliadas junto com as condições do mercado, a liquidez, o tipo de ordem, o momento, as regras de execução e as cotações disponíveis.</span>"
    },
