    },
    {
      "key": "t846e91fb814b03dd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Is Slippage Calculated?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Como o deslizamento é calculado?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta40c50343c36c0bc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage difference = Execution Price − Expected Price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Diferença de deslizamento = Preço de Execução - Preço Esperado</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0979fa14f03d7298",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage can be expressed using price units such as pips or points depending on the instrument and platform conventions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A derrapagem pode ser expressa usando unidades de preço, como pips ou pontos, dependendo do instrumento e das convenções da plataforma.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t11f77668540c2d74",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Exchange Execution</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execução em bolsa</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0ea9102611098c9e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Under Instant Execution, for example, a price movement beyond the accepted deviation may result in a requote rather than automatic execution at the changed price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Na Execução Instantânea, por exemplo, um movimento de preço além do desvio aceito pode resultar em uma nova cotação em vez de uma execução automática ao preço alterado.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe412a058d123075",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Traders should therefore understand the specific order and execution settings available through the</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">MetaTrader 5 trading platform</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> rather than assuming that one setting applies to every instrument.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Os traders devem, portanto, compreender as configurações específicas de ordens e de execução disponíveis na </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">plataforma de negociação MetaTrader 5</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">, em vez de supor que uma única configuração se aplica a todos os instrumentos.</span>"
    },
